Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Export User Calendar As ICS
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|calendarName|Test Test|
		|eventTitle|Event For Export|
		|eventType|Regular|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto My Calendars Manage
	And Calendar export Calendar File
		|calendarName|Test Test|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	Then CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Event For Export|
Scenario: Import Calendar And View Event Comment
Priority: 5
	Given TestCase get Site Name
##########################################################
The Poshi return element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	When Calendar enable Comments
		|calendarName|${siteName}|
		|calendarType|Current Site Calendars|
		|site|${siteName}|
		|user|Test Test|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|calendarName|${siteName}|
		|eventComment|Calendar Event Regular Comment|
		|eventCommentEnabled|true|
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Regular Title|
		|eventType|Regular|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|site|${siteName}|
		|user|Test Test|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarEvent view Comment
		|calendarName|${siteName}|
		|eventComment|Calendar Event Regular Comment|
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Regular Title|
		|eventType|Regular|
		|site|${siteName}|
		|user|Test Test|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And LAR export Portlet
		|larFileName|calendar_calendar_with_comments.portlet.lar|
		|portletName|Calendar|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarEvent tear Down
	And Calendar tear Down
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And LAR import Portlet
		|larFileName|calendar_calendar_with_comments.portlet.lar|
		|portletName|Calendar|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Regular Title|
	Then CalendarEvent view Comment
		|calendarName|${siteName}|
		|eventComment|Calendar Event Regular Comment|
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Regular Title|
		|eventType|Regular|
		|user|Test Test|
